---
title: Human-in-the-Loop Learning Architecture
---
flowchart TD
    classDef capture fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1e40af
    classDef llm fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#991b1b
    classDef human fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#166534
    classDef store fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#92400e

    samples[Samples arrive]:::capture
    pipeline[DSP → tokens → parse → detect]:::capture
    novelty{Novelty<br/>score}:::capture

    capsule[(Event capsule<br/>created)]:::store

    routine[Auto-classified<br/>auto-labeled]:::store
    queue[(Review queue<br/>flagged for SME)]:::store

    sme[SME reviews capsule]:::human
    voice[🎤 Voice tag<br/>or typed label]:::human
    confirm[Confirm suggested<br/>label]:::human

    asr[Local ASR<br/>Whisper on-prem]:::capture
    transcript[Transcript<br/>+ confidence]:::store

    orch[llm_orchestrator<br/>during BOOTSTRAP]:::llm
    propose[Propose canonical label<br/>+ ontology entry]:::llm
    cluster[Cluster similar tags<br/>via embeddings]:::llm

    curator[Normalization curator<br/>human review]:::human
    ontology[(Canonical ontology<br/>versioned)]:::store

    feedback[Retraining feeds:<br/>detectors, classifier,<br/>embedding model]:::store

    samples --> pipeline --> novelty
    novelty -->|low novelty<br/>known pattern| routine
    novelty -->|high novelty<br/>or low classifier confidence| queue
    routine --> capsule
    queue --> capsule

    capsule --> sme
    sme --> voice
    sme --> confirm

    voice --> asr --> transcript
    transcript -.->|queued in SEALED| transcript
    transcript -->|in BOOTSTRAP| orch

    confirm --> capsule

    orch --> cluster --> propose
    propose --> curator
    curator -->|accept| ontology
    curator -->|modify| ontology
    curator -->|reject| orch

    ontology --> feedback
    capsule --> feedback
    feedback -.->|update during next BOOTSTRAP| pipeline
